CON-11: read a pollutant in a treatment equation by that equation's type

getVariableValue() returned a referenced pollutant's inflow concentration
when the REFERENCED pollutant had a removal-type equation (or none, since
treatType 0 is REMOVAL) and its nodal concentration otherwise. The manual
(section 5.4.2) defines it by the equation being evaluated: inflow
concentration in an R = equation, nodal concentration before treatment in a
C = equation. getRemoval() now records the type of the equation it evaluates
in TreatType (restored afterwards, since an R_ reference evaluates another
equation in the middle) and getVariableValue() uses it. This restores the
meaning the code had before 5.1.008.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply CON-11_swmm530.patch

diff --git a/src/legacy/engine/treatmnt.c b/src/legacy/engine/treatmnt.c
index 3638cd3..384b483 100644
--- a/src/legacy/engine/treatmnt.c
+++ b/src/legacy/engine/treatmnt.c
@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@ static double  Q;                      // node inflow (cfs)
 static double  V;                      // node volume (ft3)
 static double* R;                      // array of pollut. removals
 static double* Cin;                    // node inflow concentrations
+static int     TreatType;              // type of treatment eqn. being evaluated
 
 //-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 //  External functions (declared in funcs.h)
@@ -334,7 +335,6 @@ double getVariableValue(int varCode)
 {
     int    p;
     double a1, a2, y;
-    TTreatment* treatment;
 
     // --- variable is a process variable
     if ( varCode < PVMAX )
@@ -370,9 +370,10 @@ double getVariableValue(int varCode)
     // --- variable is a pollutant concentration
     else if ( varCode < PVMAX + Nobjects[POLLUT] )
     {
+        // --- inflow concen. for a removal-type eqn., nodal concen.
+        //     before treatment for a concen.-type eqn.
         p = varCode - PVMAX;
-        treatment = &Node[J].treatment[p];
-        if ( treatment->treatType == REMOVAL ) return Cin[p];
